UID:va-oaa-fy28-due-20261027@more-grant-radar
DTSTAMP:20261025T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] Virginia OAA — locality grants (FY27 final new-award window 10/27 / FY28 apps due 3/2/2027) — due
DESCRIPTION:Every VA city and county has a settlement allocation it can only unlock by getting an abatement project approved. Get MORE named as the evidence-based training contractor in locality applications before the 10/27/2026 final new-FY2027 cutoff\, or in FY2028 new applications (due 3/2/2027).\n\nPath: Sub · Priority 15.9\nhttps://www.oaa.virginia.gov/media/governorvirginiagov/oaa/documents/Guidance-Individual-Distribution-Gold-Standard.pdf
URL:https://www.oaa.virginia.gov/media/governorvirginiagov/oaa/documents/Guidance-Individual-Distribution-Gold-Standard.pdf
