BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ojjdp-jdtc-fy26-due-20261029@more-grant-radar
DTSTAMP:20261025T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] OJJDP FY 2026 Juvenile Drug Treatment Court Program — due
DESCRIPTION:Funds governments to start (Cat 1) or enhance (Cat 2) juvenile drug treatment courts for youth with SUD or co-occurring MH and substance use disorders. Cat 2 explicitly covers improving 'the quality and types of treatment services'\, so MORE training for the JDTC's treatment provider could be a contractual line item. MORE's fit is weakened because the program is youth-only and very small (4 awards).\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 1.0\nhttps://www.ojp.gov/funding/docs/ojjdp-2026-172741.pdf
URL:https://www.ojp.gov/funding/docs/ojjdp-2026-172741.pdf
