DTSTAMP:20261025T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] BJA COSSUP Training & Technical Assistance (FY26) — due
DESCRIPTION:One national award to train and advise COSSUP grantees on overdose and substance-use responses in the justice system\, and for-profits may apply. MORE fits best as the clinical-training partner inside a national TTA provider's bid.\n\nPath: Direct/Sub · Priority 12.6\nhttps://bja.ojp.gov/funding/opportunities/o-bja-2026-172724
URL:https://bja.ojp.gov/funding/opportunities/o-bja-2026-172724
