DTSTAMP:20261025T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] Ohio AG Opioid Remediation — jail addiction programs (CY2026) — due
DESCRIPTION:$20M/yr for county jails and CBCFs to stand up addiction programming — 'new contract services related to OUD' explicitly qualifies\, so a jail grantee contracts More Therapy to train its treatment staff in MORE. Rolling review through Dec 1.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 15.9\nhttps://www.ohioattorneygeneral.gov/getattachment/ed88813d-94c9-4e90-ba0f-7d43614444e2/ed88813d-94c9-4e90-ba0f-7d43614444e2.aspx
