DESCRIPTION:NCCIH wants trials of mind and body practices\, naming mindfulness meditation first\, that work through emotional well-being. MORE's positive-affect and savoring mechanism is a direct match\, and for-profits can apply.\n\nPath: Direct/Sub · Priority 22.7\nhttp://grants.nih.gov/grants/guide/pa-files/PAR-25-449.html
