SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] HRSA RCORP — FY27 cycle (Overdose Response\, HRSA-27-040 forecast) — cycle watch
DESCRIPTION:HRSA has forecast an FY27 RCORP-Overdose Response round (35 × $300K) that lists for-profits as eligible\, which is rare for federal SUD money. MORE fits best as the evidence-based treatment/workforce piece of a rural applicant's plan (or a direct application with rural partners). Whether training is an allowable cost can't be confirmed until the NOFO posts.\n\nPath: Direct · Priority 16.4\nhttps://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/6e9b19d6-ad0b-423f-830e-97341e72b6da
