SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] OneOhio Recovery Foundation — Regional Grant Cycle 3 (not yet announced) — cycle watch
DESCRIPTION:Ohio's 55% opioid-settlement foundation. Cycle 2 was $45.8M across 19 regions\, and private for-profits whose services meet the Foundation's charitable purpose could apply. Workforce development / BH continuing-education priorities in some regions fit MORE training. Cycle 3 is not announced yet\, and More Therapy's Ohio SoS registration under its EIN (2 consecutive years) is the gating item.\n\nPath: Direct · Priority 15.8\nhttps://www.oneohiofoundation.com/grants
